# POC-VMS-41 read-only verifier audit

- Confirm the verifier opens the final bundle read-only and never mutates the live or future audit bundle.
- Confirm every regular file except `final-receipt.json` and `COMMITTED` is re-enumerated, rehashed, and matched exactly to the receipt.
- Confirm the copied freeze manifest, COMMITTED marker, four attempt identities, invocation hashes, candidate evaluations, tool audits, file-set audits and aggregate are independently replayed.
- Confirm symlinks, unknown/missing artifacts, hash drift, non-finite JSON, model/profile drift and premature manual/final PASS fail closed.
- Confirm a clean live bundle remains `PENDING_MANUAL_AUDIT / NOT_YET_DECIDABLE`; this verifier cannot sign semantic fidelity or component qualification.
- Confirm there are no DB, Redis, Seven, Target Solver, model or network calls.
